Vendored tokenizer test assets — separate upstream terms
=========================================================

The files in this directory are tracked in the Basetenkenizer Git source
repository solely as reference fixtures for continuous integration,
compatibility testing, and tokenizer conversion tests. They are not part of
the Basetenkenizer library implementation.

These files are included when the Git source repository is cloned or
archived. They are excluded from the published crates.io package by
`Cargo.toml` and are not installed as data files by the Basetenkenizer Python
wheel.

Unless a file expressly states otherwise, the upstream-derived tokenizer
configurations, vocabularies, chat templates, model data, and custom model
code in this directory are NOT offered under the top-level Basetenkenizer
license. No additional license to reuse those files is granted by Baseten.
Each file remains subject to the copyright, license, model terms, acceptable
use terms, and other restrictions of its respective upstream source.

Possession of a copy through this repository does not establish permission to
redistribute or reuse it. Before using any file outside Basetenkenizer's tests,
identify its upstream source and independently confirm that the intended use
is permitted. `source.json` files, where present, record source repositories
and revisions for audit purposes; absence of such a file is not a grant of
rights.
